# gfxcap: bundled HLSL decompiler binaries must be tracked despite the
# global *.exe/*.dll ignores above -- they ship inside the release zip
# (plugins/hlsl-decompiler/) and both gfxcli dump and the GUI's HLSL
# view depend on them at runtime.
!.gfxcap/3rdparty/hlsl-decompiler/*.exe
!.gfxcap/3rdparty/hlsl-decompiler/*.dll
